# Shell scripts must stay LF so the committed gate runner executes on any OS.
*.sh text eol=lf
# EVERY file the defect pass mutates must stay LF in the WORKING TREE, because
# its mutations are multi-line perl patterns using \n. Under core.autocrlf=true a
# `git checkout` rewrites a checked-out file to CRLF, and \n then matches nothing
# -- which silently broke seven defect rows on 2026-09-14. They did not error;
# they reported GATE: PASS while planting nothing. The blobs were LF throughout;
# only the working copy was converted, by the recovery step itself.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
# Binary assets -- never apply text/EOL conversion.
*.png binary
